                </p>

                <span class="volunteer-tag">
                    2-4 week commitment
                </span>

            </div>


            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="volunteer-card">

                <div class="volunteer-icon volunteer-icon-two">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i>
                </div>

                <h3>Coaching Internships</h3>

                <p>
                    Shadow experienced coaches, assist in training sessions,
                    and develop your coaching skills. Ideal for physical
                    education students and aspiring sports professionals.
                </p>

                <span class="volunteer-tag">
                    3-6 month program
                </span>

            </div>


            <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="volunteer-card">

                <div class="volunteer-icon volunteer-icon-three">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wheelchair"></i>
                </div>

                <h3>Special Needs Support</h3>

                <p>
                    Volunteers with backgrounds in special education,
                    occupational therapy, or counseling provide one-on-one
                    support for children with intellectual disabilities
                    during programs.
                </p>

                <span class="volunteer-tag volunteer-tag-blue">
                    Ongoing opportunities
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>





